  </div> <div class="claim"> <div id="CLM-00018" num="00018" class="claim">
    <div class="claim-text"> <b>18</b>. A method for preventing oxidation of a polyolefin separator in a lithium ion secondary battery comprising the steps of: 
<div class="claim-text">providing a lithium ion secondary battery having a positive electrode, a separator and an interface between said positive electrode and said separator, </div> <div class="claim-text">positioning an oxidation barrier layer between the interface of the positive electrode and the separator, the oxidation barrier layer being made of a polymer having a resistance to oxidation greater than PE. </div> </div>
  </div>
  </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00019" num="00019" class="claim">
    <div class="claim-text"> <b>19</b>. The method for preventing oxidation of a polyolefin separator in a lithium ion secondary battery according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00018">claim 18</claim-ref> where said oxidation barrier is selected from the group of polypropylene and a halocarbon. </div>
  </div>
  </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00020" num="00020" class="claim">
    <div class="claim-text"> <b>20</b>. The method for preventing oxidation of a polyolefin separator in a lithium ion secondary battery according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00019">claim 19</claim-ref> where said oxidation barrier is a halocarbon selected from the group of: polyvinylidene fluoride, polytetrafluoro ethylene and copolymers of halocarbons. </div>
  </div>
  </div> <div class="claim"> <div id="CLM-00021" num="00021" class="claim">
    <div class="claim-text"> <b>21</b>. A method for preventing oxidation of a polyolefin separator in a lithium ion secondary battery comprising the steps of: 
<div class="claim-text">providing a lithium ion secondary battery having a positive electrode, a separator and an interface between said positive electrode and said separator, </div> <div class="claim-text">coating an oxidation barrier onto said separator where said oxidation barrier is in contact with said positive electrode, said oxidation barrier being selected from the group of: polypropylene, halocarbons and TiO<sub>2</sub>. </div> </div>
  </div>
  </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00022" num="00022" class="claim">
    <div class="claim-text"> <b>22</b>. The method for preventing oxidation of a polyolefin separator in a lithium ion secondary battery according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00021">claim 21</claim-ref> where the coating of said oxide barrier is at least one molecule thick. </div>
  </div>
  </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00023" num="00023" class="claim">
    <div class="claim-text"> <b>23</b>. The method for preventing oxidation of a polyolefin separator in a lithium ion secondary battery according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00021">claim 21</claim-ref> where the coating of said oxide barrier has a density of &lt;0.4 mg/cm<sup>2</sup>. </div>
  </div>
  </div> <div class="claim"> <div id="CLM-00024" num="00024" class="claim">
    <div class="claim-text"> <b>24</b>. A method for preventing oxidation of a polyolefin separator in a lithium ion secondary battery comprising the steps of: 
<div class="claim-text">providing a lithium ion secondary battery having a positive electrode, a separator and an interface between said positive electrode and said separator, </div> <div class="claim-text">coating an oxidation barrier onto said positive electrode where said oxidation barrier is in contact with said separator, said oxidation barrier being selected from the group of: polypropylene, halocarbons and metal oxides. </div> </div>
  </div>
  </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00025" num="00025" class="claim">
    <div class="claim-text"> <b>25</b>. The method for preventing oxidation of a polyolefin separator in a lithium ion secondary battery according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00024">claim 24</claim-ref> where the coating of said oxide barrier is at least one molecule thick. </div>
  </div>
  </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00026" num="00026" class="claim">
    <div class="claim-text"> <b>26</b>. The method for preventing oxidation of a polyolefin separator in a lithium ion secondary battery according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00024">claim 24</claim-ref> where the coating of said oxide barrier has a density of &lt;0.4 mg/cm<sup>2</sup>. </div>
  </div>
  </div> <div class="claim"> <div id="CLM-00027" num="00027" class="claim">
    <div class="claim-text"> <b>27</b>. A method for preventing oxidation of a polyolefin separator in a lithium ion secondary battery comprising the steps of: 
<div class="claim-text">providing a lithium ion secondary battery having a positive electrode, a separator and an interface between said positive electrode and said separator, </div> <div class="claim-text">adding antioxidant to said separator, where said antioxidants are selected from the group of: phenols, phosphorous containing compounds and combinations thereof. </div> </div>
  </div>
  </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00028" num="00028" class="claim">
    <div class="claim-text"> <b>28</b>. The method for preventing oxidation of a polyolefin separator in a lithium ion secondary battery according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00027">claim 27</claim-ref> where said antioxidants are added at a level of 1% to 10% by weight of said separator. </div>
  </div>
  </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00029" num="00029" class="claim">
    <div class="claim-text"> <b>29</b>. The method for preventing oxidation of a polyolefin separator in a lithium ion secondary battery according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00027">claim 27</claim-ref> where said antioxidants are added at a face of said separator that will be juxtaposed to said positive electrode. </div>
  </div>
  </div> <div class="claim"> <div id="CLM-00030" num="00030" class="claim">
    <div class="claim-text"> <b>30</b>. A method for preventing oxidation of a polyolefin separator in a lithium ion secondary battery comprising the steps of: 
<div class="claim-text">providing a lithium ion secondary battery having a positive electrode, a separator and an interface between said positive electrode and said separator, </div> <div class="claim-text">coating a discrete antioxidant barrier to said separator at said interface between said separator and said positive electrode, where said antioxidants are selected from the group of: phenols, phosphorous containing compounds and combinations thereof. </div> </div>
  </div>
  </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00031" num="00031" class="claim">
    <div class="claim-text"> <b>31</b>. The method for preventing oxidation of a polyolefin separator in a lithium ion secondary battery according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00030">claim 30</claim-ref> where said antioxidant barrier is coated by a coating method selected from the group of: brushing, spaying, applying via roller or applying by immersion. </div>
  </div>
  </div> <div class="claim"> <div id="CLM-00032" num="00032" class="claim">
    <div class="claim-text"> <b>32</b>. A method for preventing oxidation of a polyolefin separator in a lithium ion secondary battery comprising the steps of: 
<div class="claim-text">providing a lithium ion secondary battery having a positive electrode, a separator and an interface between said positive electrode and said separator, </div> <div class="claim-text">coating a discrete antioxidant barrier to said positive electrode at said interface between said positive electrode and said separator, where said antioxidants are selected from the group of: phenols, phosphorous containing compounds and combinations thereof. </div> </div>
  </div>
  </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00033" num="00033" class="claim">
    <div class="claim-text"> <b>33</b>. The method for preventing oxidation of a polyolefin separator in a lithium ion secondary battery according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00032">claim 32</claim-ref> where said antioxidant barrier is coated by a coating method selected from the group of: brushing, spaying, applying via roller or applying by immersion.</div>
  </div>
